      "writtenOn": "2026-11-20T09:46:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When one module imports X pinned and another imports X unpinned, both land in this HashSet and the first one iterated wins. It wins just because it happened to be looked at first, not because of an actual requirement, right? Could we iterate pinned requirements first in a deterministic order, and log when a different requirement for the same name is skipped?",
      "revId": "4de3a9308f0b7adbb7dfb0c6a5b8da0b2caf206f",
      "serverId": "7fc14799-209e-464c-9743-7a06c2c21a81"
    },
