      },
      "lineNbr": 629,
      "author": {
        "id": 8324
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-11-20T09:46:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This retries on any build failure as long as some versionless model has several stored versions, which becomes nearly always true once a second openconfig-types or ietf-yang-types is uploaded. A broken vendor model then costs up to 10 extra full rebuilds per connection attempt on the 4-thread gNMI pool, and failures are not cached, so reconnects repeat it. Could we retry only when the parser\u0027s failing source is, or imports, a lowerable model?",
      "revId": "4de3a9308f0b7adbb7dfb0c6a5b8da0b2caf206f",
      "serverId": "7fc14799-209e-464c-9743-7a06c2c21a81"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ba6a1a28_6fc39990",
        "filename": "modules/gnmi-sb/src/main/java/org/opendaylight/gnmi/southbound/schema/impl/SchemaContextHolderImpl.java",
        "patchSetId": 31
      },
      "lineNbr": 629,
      "author": {
        "id": 9229
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-11-23T10:07:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Only models involved in the failure are lowered now",
      "parentUuid": "2c9db464_64e2d5d6",
      "revId": "4de3a9308f0b7adbb7dfb0c6a5b8da0b2caf206f",
      "serverId": "7fc14799-209e-464c-9743-7a06c2c21a81"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "854b7d64_e29a3119",
        "filename": "modules/gnmi-sb/src/main/java/org/opendaylight/gnmi/southbound/schema/impl/SchemaContextHolderImpl.java",
        "patchSetId": 31
      },
      "lineNbr": 650,
