        "id": 8324
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-11-20T09:46:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Only SchemaException is caught here, so if a retry times out reading the store, getSchemaContext wraps just the timeout and the real failure from the first attempt (parser error, missing models) is dropped. Could we also catch ExecutionException | TimeoutException here, add the message to firstFailure and throw that?",
      "revId": "4de3a9308f0b7adbb7dfb0c6a5b8da0b2caf206f",
